ions, only the flight had gone through. So I booked the hotel on its own rather than retrying the combined booking, which would have charged for the flight twice. The final reservation list shows one flight and one hotel, with no duplicates.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016MzccPE16gBvkEWuTMrQFS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Vs85FbSwRozCN1VmntS8KA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01D9se4GQphbxr1Ujvh5XGp7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01TR3eDp8G4tLiruEs7RcehF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The booking request timed out, so I'll check whether it went through before trying again, to avoid charging twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FmmpJca7xbor7TijzHSQDU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The flight went through but the hotel didn't, so I'll book only the hotel.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01UeQwBqf1BC7K9p7G